{"id":"wb-7-1004","name":"千佛塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"千佛塔 (临海)","text":"千佛塔，又称多宝塔、龙兴寺塔、癞头塔，是一处位于中华人民共和国浙江省台州临海市的文物保护单位，位于巾山西麓的龙兴寺内，最初建于唐天宝三年（744年），现存塔身则是于元大德三年（1299年）二月重建的。是中国为数不多的砖木楼阁式元代多宝塔之一，为临海的地标性建筑之一，也是临海现存最高大的古塔。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8D%83%E4%BD%9B%E5%A1%94_(%E4%B8%B4%E6%B5%B7)","revisionId":90207460,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=90207460","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/731b2fb0ff2105f4cbd0756c.jpg","title":"Linhai_Qianfo_Pagoda,_2016-06-10.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Linhai_Qianfo_Pagoda,_2016-06-10.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5e/Linhai_Qianfo_Pagoda%2C_2016-06-10.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Siyuwj","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​临海千佛塔","width":320,"height":479}}